04:48.280 --> 04:52.440
So you see this box that I've drawn, you draw the box from the BPR, right?

04:52.440 --> 04:54.400
The old Fair Value Gap, you drag it along.

04:54.760 --> 05:01.040
And if any part of the Fair Value Gap, even a tiny bit is in that level, in this box,

05:01.680 --> 05:03.240
then you can take your entry from BPR.

